<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>552 Commando</Major>
    <Description>Recoil Macro for 552 Commando IQ/ Grim. As always, not a perfect recoil, but good enough for 10 meter engagement and should be tight enough for upper body at any range

Loadout: Vertical, Comp/extended, Acog

Res: 16:10, 1920 x1080

Sensitivity 6,6

800 Dpi</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
MoveR 0 40
Delay 35 ms
MoveR 0 50
Delay 35 ms
MoveR 0 45
Delay 35 ms
MoveR -15 40
Delay 35 ms
LeftUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>